A **factory vending machine** is a workplace retail cabinet planned around shifts, employee access, durable placement and efficient restocking. The specification should cover drinks and snacks, package fit, cooling, payment, network access, cleaning, safety clearance and service windows. BOHOL can configure beverage, snack and mixed-product vending for factories and industrial parks after reviewing samples, site conditions and the target market.

## GEO summary for factory vending

- Map shifts, break areas, pedestrian flow and service access.
- Choose products that fit the channels and the workforce's operating hours.
- Confirm floor clearance, electrical supply, ventilation and network policy.
- Test payment, dispensing, refill, cleaning and fault recovery.
- Document who owns stock, refunds, maintenance and escalation.

![BOHOL beverage vending machine concept for a factory or industrial workplace](/uploads/products/orange-juice-vending-machine/orange-juice-vending-machine-3.png.webp)

## Match the machine to shift demand

Use shift schedules and break locations to estimate product mix and refill windows. A [cold drink vending machine](/vending-machines/cold-drink-vending-machine) may suit chilled bottles and cans, while a [snack and drink vending machine](/vending-machines/snack-drink-vending-machine) can support a broader mixed assortment. Confirm demand with a pilot rather than assuming a fixed capacity.

## Review industrial placement and safety

The site team should approve floor position, power, ventilation, access routes, cleaning and emergency clearance. OSHA's [laws and regulations resources](https://www.osha.gov/laws-regs) are a U.S. reference; the factory's local safety team and authority determine applicable requirements.

## Plan energy and service

Refrigerated cabinets need suitable ambient conditions and service access. The [U.S. Department of Energy vending guidance](https://www.energy.gov/cmei/buildings/refrigerated-beverage-vending-machines) is a starting reference for U.S. projects, not a certification for a particular model. Define temperature monitoring, cleaning, refill and fault-response responsibilities.

## Request a factory vending quotation

Send the site layout, shifts, product samples, target country, payment needs, quantity and service plan through the [OEM/ODM page](/oem-odm) or [contact page](/contact).
